// Silence is the failure mode a scheduled job has that a running service does
// not: nothing errors, nothing alerts, and the bot simply stops trading.
//
// summarize without a by clause always returns exactly one row, including zero.
// Without it the query returns no rows when nothing ran, and an alert on an
// empty result set never fires, which is precisely the case being watched for.
ContainerAppConsoleLogs_CL
| where ContainerName_s == "trading-cycle"
| extend payload = parse_json(Log_s)
| where tostring(payload.message) == "cycle.completed"
| summarize CompletedCycles = count()
